# A6 Approver side, sync auto-approve, the offline sign-in window, and
# pull-cloud as coordinator and superadmin (including a device that changes
# owner). tutor1 logs ARAL sessions of {class_1} on {ago3} and {ago2} (dates
# no other batch uses) and deletes them again; the settings go back to B0's
# (school done threshold 85, nothing else). Region-wide writes are refusals
# only. Every upload is decided before the batch ends, so it reruns.

device a6-phone tutor fresh
as tutor1
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run offline-status
expect Offline sign-in: {email_tutor1}
expect window 14 days

# --- Offline sign-in window (coordinator) -------------------------------------
device coord-pc admin
as coord
run offline-days {school}
expect Offline sign-in window: region not set · school not set · applies 14 days
run offline-days {school} extra
refuse Usage: offline-days <region|schoolId>
run offline-days nowhere
refuse Invalid school: "nowhere" (a school id or region)
run offline-days-set {school}
refuse Usage: offline-days-set <region|schoolId> <1-60>
run offline-days-set {school} two
refuse The window is a whole number of days (got "two").
run offline-days-set {school} {=0}
refuse The offline sign-in window is 1 to 60 days, not 0.
run offline-days-set {school} {=61}
refuse The offline sign-in window is 1 to 60 days, not 61.
run offline-days-set region {=30}
refuse Forbidden: only the superadmin sets the region-wide report settings.
run offline-days-set {schoolB} {=30}
refuse Forbidden: you can only set your own school's report settings.
# A device that is behind (F20): another device resets the school's row, the
# server gives the new row a new id, then this device writes.
device a6-pc2 admin fresh
as coord
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
device coord-pc admin
run report-settings-reset {school}
expect School {school} now uses the region report settings.
run report-settings-set {school} {=85}
expect Done threshold for school {school}: 85%.
device a6-pc2 admin
run offline-days-set {school} {=3}
expect Offline sign-in window for school {school}: 3 days. Tablets get it after their next pull-cloud.
run offline-days {school}
expect Offline sign-in window: region not set · school 3 days · applies 3 days
device coord-pc admin
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run offline-days {school}
expect Offline sign-in window: region not set · school 3 days · applies 3 days

# The phone keeps 14 days until it pulls.
device a6-phone tutor
run offline-status
expect window 14 days
run pull-cloud yes
expect report_settings
run offline-status
expect window 3 days
run sign-out
expect Signed out.
run sign-in-offline {email_tutor1} {pw_tutor1}
expect Signed in offline as {email_tutor1}
# Offline: work that needs the server is refused.
run pull-cloud yes
refuse This needs an online sign-in. Sign in again while connected.
run sync-upload yes
refuse This needs an online sign-in. Sign in again while connected.

# --- Auto-approve off: a tutor's upload waits ---------------------------------
device coord-pc admin
run sync-auto-approve {school}
expect Auto-approve: region not set · school not set · applies off
run sync-auto-approve {school} maybe
refuse Usage: sync-auto-approve <region|schoolId> [on|off]
run sync-auto-approve
refuse Usage: sync-auto-approve <region|schoolId> [on|off]
run sync-auto-approve region on
refuse Forbidden: only the superadmin sets the region-wide report settings.
run sync-auto-approve {schoolB} on
refuse Forbidden: you can only set your own school's report settings.
run sync-pending
expect Nothing is waiting for approval.
expect 0 upload(s) still pending.
run sync-approve latest
expect Nothing is waiting for approval.

device a6-phone tutor
as tutor1
run aral-log {class_1} 30 during_class {ago3} lesson "ZZ A6 one"
expect Logged:
capture a6_s1 = Logged: #(-?\d+)
run aral-mark-rest {a6_s1} present
expect present.
run sync-upload yes
expect waiting for approval.
capture a6_u1 = Upload (\d+) sent

device coord-pc admin
run sync-pending
expect Waiting for approval (oldest first):
expect~ {a6_u1}  ZZTEST Pass Tutor1 r{run}
expect 1 upload(s) still pending.
run sync-pending {school}
expect 1 upload(s) still pending.
run sync-pending {schoolB}
refuse Forbidden: you can only review your own school's uploads.
run sync-pending x
refuse Usage: sync-pending [schoolId]
run sync-show latest
expect Upload {a6_u1} by ZZTEST Pass Tutor1 r{run}
expect pending
expect~ ARAL session \d+ \({ago3}\): new, with 3 attendance marks
run sync-show
refuse Usage: sync-show <upload id>|latest
run sync-show {=999999999}
refuse Upload 999999999 not found (or not one you can review).
run sync-approve abc
refuse Usage: sync-approve <upload id>|latest
run sync-approve {=999999999}
refuse Upload 999999999 not found (or not one you can review).
run sync-reject {a6_u1} 
refuse The reason is 501 characters; keep it to 500.

# --- Auto-approve on: uploads already waiting still wait; new ones apply ------
run sync-auto-approve {school} on
expect Auto-approve for school {school} is now on.
expect Uploads already waiting still need sync-approve.
run sync-auto-approve {school}
expect Auto-approve: region not set · school on · applies on
run sync-pending
expect 1 upload(s) still pending.

device a6-phone tutor
run aral-log {class_1} 30 during_class {ago2} lesson "ZZ A6 two"
expect Logged:
capture a6_s2 = Logged: #(-?\d+)
run aral-mark-rest {a6_s2} present
expect present.
run sync-upload yes
expect applied: 4 row(s) now on the server.
capture a6_u2 = Upload (\d+)
sql select count(*) from aral_sessions where held_on = '{ago2}' and id < 0 => 0
run sync-status
expect~ {a6_u2}  applied
expect~ {a6_u1}  pending

# The coordinator decides the waiting one.
device coord-pc admin
run sync-approve latest
expect Upload {a6_u1} applied.
run sync-approve {a6_u1}
refuse Upload {a6_u1} is applied, not pending
run sync-reject {a6_u1} ZZ too late
refuse Could not reject upload {a6_u1}: Upload {a6_u1} is applied, not pending
run sync-pending
expect Nothing is waiting for approval.
run sync-auto-approve {school} off
expect Auto-approve for school {school} is now off.

device a6-phone tutor
run sync-status
expect Upload {a6_u1} applied
run aral-sessions
expect ZZ A6 one
expect ZZ A6 two
capture a6_s1_srv = #(\d+) \| class #{class_1} \| session \d+ \| {ago3}
capture a6_s2_srv = #(\d+) \| class #{class_1} \| session \d+ \| {ago2}
sql select count(*) from aral_sessions where id < 0 => 0

# --- The superadmin: pull, region reads, review a school's upload -------------
device a6-super admin fresh
as super
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
expect Done. Local data now belongs to zztest.super@basa.test.
sql select count(*) from schools where id in ({school}, {schoolB}) => 2
sql select count(*) from aral_sessions where id in ({a6_s1_srv}, {a6_s2_srv}) => 2
run offline-days region
expect Offline sign-in window: region not set · applies 14 days
run offline-days {school}
expect Offline sign-in window: region not set · school 3 days · applies 3 days
run sync-auto-approve region
expect Auto-approve: region not set · applies off
run offline-days-set region {=0}
refuse The offline sign-in window is 1 to 60 days, not 0.
run sync-pending {school}
expect Nothing is waiting for approval.

# tutor1 deletes both sessions (auto-approve is off again: it waits).
device a6-phone tutor
run aral-session-delete {a6_s1_srv}
expect Deleted ARAL session {a6_s1_srv}.
run aral-session-delete {a6_s2_srv}
expect Deleted ARAL session {a6_s2_srv}.
run sync-upload yes
expect waiting for approval.
capture a6_u3 = Upload (\d+)

device a6-super admin
run sync-pending
expect~ {a6_u3}  ZZTEST Pass Tutor1 r{run}
run sync-pending {school}
expect 1 upload(s) still pending.
run sync-show {a6_u3}
expect Upload {a6_u3} by ZZTEST Pass Tutor1 r{run}
expect~ pending \(school {school} ZZTEST PASS r{run}\)
expect~ ARAL session \d+ \({ago3}\): deleted, 3 attendance marks deleted
expect~ ARAL session \d+ \({ago2}\): deleted, 3 attendance marks deleted
run sync-approve {a6_u3}
expect Upload {a6_u3} applied.

device a6-phone tutor
run sync-status
expect Upload {a6_u3} applied
sql select count(*) from aral_sessions where id in ({a6_s1_srv}, {a6_s2_srv}) => 0
run sync-preview
expect Nothing to upload.

# --- One device, two users: the coordinator's unsent work blocks the superadmin
device a6-shared admin fresh
as coord
run pull-cloud yes
expect Done. Local data now belongs to {email_coord}.
run aral-log {class_1} {=30} during_class {ago2} lesson "ZZ A6 shared"
expect Logged:
capture a6_s4 = Logged: #(-?\d+)
as super
run pull-cloud
expect This device holds work of {email_coord} that is not on the server yet; the pull will refuse until they sync
run pull-cloud yes
refuse Refused: this device holds work of {email_coord} that is not on the server yet:
run sync-upload yes
refuse This device's work belongs to {email_coord}; only they can sync it.
run pull-cloud yes discard-local
expect Discarded this device's unsent work: 1 new record(s), 0 change(s) to server records.
expect Replaced the copy of {email_coord}.
expect Done. Local data now belongs to zztest.super@basa.test.
sql select count(*) from aral_sessions where id = {a6_s4} => 0

# --- A tutor on the admin build reviews nothing -------------------------------
as tutor1
run sync-pending
refuse Forbidden: only an admin or coordinator reviews uploads.
run sync-approve latest
refuse Forbidden: only an admin or coordinator reviews uploads.
run offline-days-set {school} 5
refuse Forbidden: only an admin or coordinator sets the report settings.
run sync-auto-approve {school} on
refuse Forbidden: only an admin or coordinator sets the report settings.

# --- Back to B0's settings -------------------------------------------------------
device coord-pc admin
run report-settings-reset {school}
expect School {school} now uses the region report settings.
run report-settings-set {school} {=85}
expect Done threshold for school {school}: 85%.
run offline-days {school}
expect Offline sign-in window: region not set · school not set · applies 14 days
run sync-auto-approve {school}
expect Auto-approve: region not set · school not set · applies off
run sync-pending
expect Nothing is waiting for approval.

# --- Signed out: nothing works ---------------------------------------------------
run sign-out
expect Signed out.
run sync-pending
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run sync-show latest
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run sync-approve latest
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run sync-reject latest ZZ no
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run offline-days {school}
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run offline-days-set {school} {=5}
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run sync-auto-approve {school}
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run sync-auto-approve {school} on
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
